### 10. Mid-Autumn third prize
POST {{lotteryBaseUrl}}/api/admin/campaigns/{{midAutumnCampaignId}}/prizes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prizeCode": "MID_AUTUMN_COUPON",
  "name": "NT$200 購物金",
  "prizeType": "PRIZE",
  "probability": 0.10,
  "totalStock": 300,
  "displayOrder": 3,
