### 11. Mid-Autumn no-prize item
POST {{lotteryBaseUrl}}/api/admin/campaigns/{{midAutumnCampaignId}}/prizes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prizeCode": "MID_AUTUMN_NO_PRIZE",
  "name": "銘謝惠顧",
  "prizeType": "NO_PRIZE",
  "probability": 0.87,
  "totalStock": 0,
