}

### 12. Activate Mid-Autumn campaign
POST {{lotteryBaseUrl}}/api/admin/campaigns/{{midAutumnCampaignId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Verify both campaigns are available
GET {{lotteryBaseUrl}}/api/lottery/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
